  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math> be a solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;Where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mo>Lim</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "JSqEP",
      "text": "is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
